1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:07,040
I've been waiting for you.

25
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:08,480
Ye Wuyou
First generation Suzaku

26
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:10,480
Ye Wuyou ?

27
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,560
What does Senior mean ?

28
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,400
Throughout generations, the successive Suzakus

29
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:21,080
were always appointed by the previous Suzaku.

30
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,400
The only way to inherit the legacy

31
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,400
is to obtain the Suzaku Seal

32
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,960
and seize control of the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

33
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:32,760
But if someone attempts to destroy the crystal,

34
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:36,120
then it will choose its own master

35
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,480
and make him the Suzaku.

36
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,200
And you

37
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:44,440
were chosen by the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

38
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:54,760
Why does he have the aura of the Suzaku Seal ?

39
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,280
That's...

40
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,000
the Suzaku's inheritance !

41
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,440
Impossible...

42
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,800
Impossible !

43
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,800
Without Zhuque Zi's approval,

44
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:23,080
how could he obtain the Suzaku's inheritance ?

45
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,720
Throughout 14 generations of Suzakus,

46
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:32,200
this is the first time the crystal has been destroyed.

47
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,040
So choosing him now

48
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,640
makes a lot of sense.

49
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:40,240
Are you willing to become the titled Suzaku ?

50
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:42,880
Will you be planet Suzaku's guardian

51
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:45,000
until the end of your lifespan ?

52
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,200
I'm not willing.

53
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,360
If you become the Suzaku,

54
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:58,400
you will be the supreme ruler of planet Suzaku

55
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,520
and worshipped by everyone.

56
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,920
The Heavenly Jade Sect
The Earth Soul Sect
The Immortal's Path Sect

57
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,000
pays respect to the Suzaku.

58
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,200
As Suzaku,

59
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:10,120
countless treasures will be yours.

60
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:14,400
There will be no obstacles in your cultivation.

61
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,800
If you leave now,

62
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:19,240
you will face countless dangers.

63
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:22,800
One misstep can lead to certain death.

64
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,800
If you stay and accept the Suzaku Seal,

65
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,560
you will rule the planet

66
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,920
and live a carefree life.

67
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,160
Why would you refuse ?

68
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,120
My path

69
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,600
won't stop at just planet Suzaku.

70
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,600
Very well.

71
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,360
To each their own,

72
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,160
I can't force you.

73
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,040
Senior,

74
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:29,120
how do I retrieve my soul strand ?

75
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:32,280
There are only two methods.

76
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:35,960
The first is to kill the spirit that holds your soul strand.

77
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,600
But finding your soul strand

78
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,600
among all those spirits

79
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,040
is unlikely

80
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,560
and cannot be forced.

81
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,560
The second method

82
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,720
is to trade

83
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,640
a life for a life.

84
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,280
You can go.

85
00:05:57,960 --> 00:06:00,960
He actually rejected the Suzaku's inheritance ?

86
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:04,320
A life for a life ?

87
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:07,760
These two are my mortal enemies,

88
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:11,320
they're perfect to exchange for my soul strand.

89
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:15,560
But direct disciples of the Suzaku will be hard to kill.

90
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,880
I should make a distraction first

91
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,080
to weaken them.

92
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,760
The Cultivation Planet Crystal doesn't have a master.

93
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,880
Whoever obtains it

94
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:27,640
will rule planet Suzaku.

95
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,640
The Cultivation Planet Crystal !?

96
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,680
Rule planet Suzaku !?

97
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,960
This is a tremendous opportunity !

98
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:32,600
It's mine !

99
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,840
It must be mine !

100
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,280
Don't you dare compete with me !

101
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,760
Suzaku Formation,

102
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:39,840
activate !

103
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,720
The Cultivation Planet Crystal

104
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,480
belongs to me !

105
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,800
Give it to me !

106
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,600
Is he being possessed ?

107
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,360
Zhuque Zi...

108
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,040
Junior Brother,

109
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:26,720
this game was getting interesting

110
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:30,760
so I borrowed Qian Feng's lifespan to come here

111
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:34,320
and properly reunite with you.

112
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,880
Did you think that

113
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:41,520
I would give up planet Suzaku so easily ?

114
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,720
You possessed and consumed your disciple's lifespan

115
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,920
in order to replenish your own.

116
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,520
Senior Brother's methods are impressive.

117
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,000
Zhuque Zi !

118
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,160
This is bad !

119
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,160
Retreat !

120
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:59,160
This doll is made from celestial iron.

121
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,960
When you're in danger, activate its mechanism

122
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:04,800
and it will save your life.

123
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:07,640
If I had used it during a battle,

124
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,080
it would have killed me

125
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,720
before I killed anyone !

126
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,280
The time has come

127
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,400
to retrieve my soul strand.

128
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:19,280
That doll is made of celestial iron

129
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,400
and required centuries to refine.

130
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,160
Could it be that...

131
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,200
Zhuque Zi nurtured me from childhood

132
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,320
just to steal my body !?

133
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,440
That old bastard !

134
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,400
You're dead !

135
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,640
Transform !
